        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 87003, Modern Hexagon Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Hexagon Door Handle is available in an array of contemporary finishes. Choose from either 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. This Modern Hex Thru-Bolt Pull bolts through the door. It comes supplied with the installation hardware and 2 screw caps to keep the interior of your door looking great. Emtek's Mod Hex Pull can be mounted on wood, metal, and fiberglass interior and exterior doors up to 1-3/4 inches thick. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/back-to-back-modern-hex-door-pull-set-emtek-btb-87003\"><b> Modern Hex Pull with Back-to-Back Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Mod Hex Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 1-3/4\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) 1\" long 1/4\"-20 screws, (2) 1\" long #10-32 screws, (2) 2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) screw caps.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87003-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Hex Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-87003:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-87004:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually with thru-bolt mounting.<i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
